This file is a subset of noto_sans, made by "modustool vector_fonts" (docs/FONTS.md):
the characters 32 to 126, the characters U+00A0 to U+00FF, the characters U+20AC,
the 2654 characters that each process draws from the outlines, in these runs:
U+0100 to U+0377
U+037A to U+037F
U+0384 to U+038A
U+038C to U+038C
U+038E to U+03A1
U+03A3 to U+03E1
U+03F0 to U+052F
U+10FB to U+10FB
U+1AB0 to U+1AC0
